sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client / KServe Router
    participant Gateway as Platform Ingress<br/>(Istio Gateway / OCP Route)
    participant API as vllm-cpu API Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Auth as AuthenticationMiddleware<br/>SHA-256 Constant-Time
    participant Engine as AsyncLLM Engine<br/>In-process
    participant HFHub as Hugging Face Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3-compatible Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 1: Inference Request (HTTP)
    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Gateway->>API: Forward request<br/>8000/TCP HTTP (mTLS via mesh)
    API->>Auth: Validate VLLM_API_KEY<br/>(SHA-256 hash comparison)
    Auth-->>API: Token valid
    API->>Engine: Submit to continuous batcher
    Engine->>Engine: PagedAttention KV-cache<br/>Token generation
    Engine-->>API: Generated tokens (streaming)
    API-->>Gateway: SSE stream response
    Gateway-->>Client: HTTP 200 streaming

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 2: Model Loading (startup)
    Engine->>HFHub: GET model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN (optional)
    HFHub-->>Engine: Model weights + tokenizer
    Engine->>Engine: Load into memory<br/>Initialize PagedAttention

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 2b: Model Loading from S3
    Engine->>S3: GET model via tensorizer<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID
    S3-->>Engine: Model artifacts

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 3: gRPC Inference
    Client->>API: VllmEngine.Generate<br/>gRPC 8000/TCP (insecure)
    API->>Engine: Submit request
    Engine-->>API: Inference result
    API-->>Client: gRPC response stream

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 4: LoRA Hot-Loading
    Client->>API: POST /v1/load_lora_adapter<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    API->>Engine: Load LoRA weights
    Engine->>S3: Fetch LoRA adapter
    S3-->>Engine: Adapter weights
    Engine-->>API: Adapter loaded
    API-->>Client: 200 OK
